{title: Nearer, Still Nearer}
{artist: Lelia Morris}
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 72}

Verse 1
[F]Nearer, still nearer, [Bb]close to thy [F]heart, [Dm]draw me, my [Bb]Savior, so [C]precious thou [F]art;
fold me, O fold me [Bb]close to thy [F]breast — [Dm]shelter me [Bb]safe in that [C]haven of [F]rest.
